{"overview":"تومورو تنما در دنیایی زندگی می‌کند که افکار و احساسات انسانی، که با نام e-Pulse شناخته می‌شوند، دستگاه‌های هوش مصنوعی به نام ساپوتاما را تغذیه می‌کنند. اما وقتی دیجیمون‌ها از ساپوتاما ظاهر می‌شوند و از e-Pulse تغذیه می‌کنند، جامعه شروع به از هم پاشیدن می‌کند. پس از اینکه گکومون از دستگاهش ظاهر می‌شود، تومورو به Glowing Dawn می‌پیوندد، یک تیم مخفی که در حال تحقیق در مورد دیجیمون‌های سرکش و حقیقت تاریک سیستمی است که هم توسط احساسات تغذیه و هم فاسد شده است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Tomoro Tenma lives in a world where human thoughts and emotions, known as e-Pulse, power AI devices called Sapotama. But when Digimon begin materializing from Sapotama and feeding on e-Pulse, society begins to fracture. After Gekkomon appears from his device, Tomoro joins Glowing Dawn, a secret team investigating rogue Digimon and the dark truth of a system both fueled and corrupted by emotion.","tagline_en":"Glitch the future.","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":49,"y":2025,"poster":"/51YLn6nq8GkqGeZsIbIkLCWgBoZ.jpg"}],"episodes":49,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"入野自由","role":"Tomoro Tenma (voice)","photo":"/8qEEhHUObNvGQr4e6eqLu5z4qTz.jpg","en":"Miyu Irino"},{"name":"潘めぐみ","role":"Gekkomon (voice)","photo":"/cwnwrPg1YvB19TbfouC4ShGPmbQ.jpg","en":"Megumi Han"},{"name":"黒沢ともよ","role":"Reina Sakuya (voice)","photo":"/eSRnva88YVcUXlDHdVrhier2SGU.jpg","en":"Tomoyo Kurosawa"},{"name":"موتسومی تامورا","role":"Pristimon (voice)","photo":"/uvbBIRiBK6GDLEESiYSFWOVlaE4.jpg","en":"Mutsumi Tamura"},{"name":"関根有咲","role":"Makoto Kuonji (voice)","photo":"/z8GTafCwhgx6cgjpuUWHOWXZCkg.jpg","en":"Arisa Sekine"},{"name":"久野美咲","role":"Chiropmon (voice)","photo":"/hVtE4gdKaqofYZmXXtlJs4Q9XTL.jpg","en":"Misaki Kuno"},{"name":"阿座上洋平","role":"Kyo Sawashiro (voice)","photo":"/rLIqw8pIjVIxPb5engrTbu9iOex.jpg","en":"Yohei Azakami"},{"name":"濱野大輝","role":"Murasamemon (voice)","photo":"/bykeH3Rhmx9PPFegYNi6s310cNa.jpg","en":"Daiki Hamano"}]